    { '@type': 'ListItem', position: 3, name: 'More candor will make it worse', item: `https://www.belegendary.org${path}` },
  ] },
  { '@type': 'Article',
    headline: 'More candor will make it worse',
    datePublished: '2026-07-25', dateModified: '2026-07-25',
    author: { '@id': 'https://www.belegendary.org/#james' },
    publisher: { '@id': 'https://www.belegendary.org/#org' },
    mainEntityOfPage: `https://www.belegendary.org${path}`,
    description: 'Two meta-analyses of intragroup conflict reach opposite conclusions about task conflict — but converge on one moderator: whether arguing about the work stays separate from arguing about each other. Why mandating candor in a fused room makes decisions worse.',
